# Every text file with Linux line endings, also on Windows checkouts (GitHub's Windows build): git's
# CRLF there made gst-plugins.txt's names end in "\r", so the Windows app folder got no GStreamer
# plugin at all (2026-11-04), and the build must be the same source as ribs03's.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.svg text eol=lf
